        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Make the right move with your #1 Agency!\r\n\r\nNestled in the highly sought-after Brookville Park development on the Ballymakenny Road, this well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation in an exceptionally convenient location on the north side of Drogheda.\r\n\r\nThe ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall with guest WC, a spacious living room featuring a large front-facing window that fills the room with natural light, a separate dining room ideal for family gatherings, and a fitted kitchen offering ample storage and worktop space with direct access to the rear garden.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the property boasts three bedrooms, including two generous double bedrooms and a comfortable single bedroom suitable for a child's room, home office, or guest accommodation. A family shower room completes the first-floor layout.\r\n\r\nOutside, the property benefits from a private rear garden and off-street parking to the front, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, families, or investors alike.\r\n\r\nLocation\r\nBrookville Park is situated on the Ballymakenny Road, one of North Drogheda's most popular residential locations. Residents enjoy easy access to an excellent selection of local amenities, including both large and independent retailers, restaurants, cafés, and traditional pubs. Sports and leisure enthusiasts are spoiled for choice with nearby golf courses, rugby and football clubs, athletics facilities, and recreational centres. There is also an excellent selection of primary and secondary schools in the area, together with a wide range of activities and amenities catering for children of all ages.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nEntrance Hall – 4.29m x 1.99m\r\nGuest WC – 1.30m x 0.84m\r\nLiving Room – 3.71m x 4.00m\r\nDining Room – 3.42m x 2.91m\r\nKitchen – 3.42m x 3.09m\r\nBedroom 1 – 4.08m x 4.08m\r\nBedroom 2 – 3.55m x 4.08m\r\nBedroom 3 – 2.64m x 2.99m\r\nShower Room – 2.11m x 1.91m\r\n\r\nBER D\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this ideally located family home has to offer."
      },
